@startuml
title Nexus Deploy - Pipeline and Deployment State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Triggered : Manual trigger
Idle --> Triggered : Git webhook

Triggered --> Queued : Create pipeline run

Queued --> Preparing : Worker assigned

Preparing --> Building : Source fetched

Building --> Testing : Build successful
Building --> Failed : Build failed

Testing --> Linting : Tests passed
Testing --> Failed : Tests failed

Linting --> Packaging : Lint successful
Linting --> Failed : Lint failed

Packaging --> Deploying : Artifact/image ready

Deploying --> HealthChecking : Deployment completed

HealthChecking --> Successful : Health checks passed
HealthChecking --> Rollback : Health checks failed

Rollback --> RollingBack : Restore previous release

RollingBack --> RolledBack : Previous release restored

Deploying --> Failed : Deployment error

Failed --> Retrying : Retry requested
Retrying --> Queued

Queued --> Cancelled : User cancels
Preparing --> Cancelled : User cancels
Building --> Cancelled : User cancels
Testing --> Cancelled : User cancels
Deploying --> Cancelled : User cancels

Successful --> [*]
RolledBack --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml